## 3. Целевая архитектура границ доменного ядра (Ideal State)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Ports["Injected Pure Ports (Zero I/O)"]
        CLK["Clock Protocol<br/>() -> AwareDatetime (monotonic UTC)"]
        MTA["MediaAllocator Protocol<br/>(lease_id, line_id) -> MediaCredentials<br/>{endpoint, agent_token != provider_token}"]
    end

    subgraph Kernel["InMemoryLineManager (Implements LineManager + LineAdminKernel)"]
        STATE["Private Mutable State<br/>Lines · ProviderBindings · LineAssignments<br/>CallLeases · Global-Seq Queue · PendingClaims"]
        E_OUT["Bounded Event Outbox<br/>EventEnvelope[PayloadT] + EventAudience"]
        C_OUT["Bounded Command Outbox<br/>ProviderCommand (1:1 with line.*)"]
        STATE --> E_OUT
        STATE --> C_OUT
    end

    Ports --> Kernel

    E_OUT -->|"drain_events() [frozen DTOs]"| EBUS["EventBus<br/>Stateless Audience Router<br/>(Broadcast | Agent | Session)"]
    C_OUT -->|"drain_provider_commands() [frozen DTOs]"| PADP["Manager Surface<br/>PROVIDER_COMMAND_WIRE_NAMES<br/>line.dial / answer / hangup / send_dtmf / revoke"]
```

